==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|рѣши́ть||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|рѣшити|t=to untie, absolve}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*rěšiti}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*wreyḱ-||to twist, bend}}. Cognates include {{cog|uk|ріши́ти}}, {{cog|be|рашы́ць}}, {{cog|sh|решити}}, {{cog|cs|řešit}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|реши́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-решить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|реши́ть|pf|impf=реша́ть}}

# to [[solve]], to [[settle]]
# to [[decide]], to [[resolve]], to [[make up one's mind]], to [[determine]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1866|author=w:ru:Фёдор Достоевский<t:{{w|Fyodor Dostoevsky}}>|title=w:ru:Преступление и наказание|chapter=s:ru:[[Преступление и наказание (Достоевский)/Часть II/Глава VI|Часть II, Глава VI]]|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:Constance Garnett|title2=s:[[Crime and Punishment/Part II/Chapter VI|Crime and Punishment]]|location2=|publisher2=|year2=1914|page2=|pageurl2=|text=«Илья́ Петро́вич — болва́н!» — '''реши́л''' он оконча́тельно.|t="Ilya Petrovitch is a blockhead," he '''decided'''.}}

